{{also|revisión|révision}}
==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪʒən}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# The act of [[revising]].
# A [[change]]d [[edition]], or new [[version]]; a [[modification]].
# A [[story]] corrected or expanded by an [[author]] [[commission]]ed by the original [[writer]].
#: ''a '''revision''' story''
# {{British|New Zealand|Australia}} {{uncountable}} The looking back over of one's (previously learnt or written) notes in preparation for a [[test]] or [[examination]].
#: ''All that [[last minute]] '''revision''' really paid off in the exam! I got top marks!''

